    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Berlin design studio founded late 2001 by Stefan Gandl; systematic design and typography for print, screen and space, and a well-known in-house type library (NB Akademie, NB Architekt, NB National, NB Grotesk). Books Neubau Welt (2005) and Neubau Modul (2007) are design-world staples. Classed Studio (design practice that also sells its own fonts) rather than Foundry, since its work spans identity and editorial beyond type; existing tags Graphic design + Type design fit. Long-running, highly regarded, founder-led small studio (Size 2-10 inferred). Verify the IG handle before relying.",
